    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/e3ccb5c19ea728979482a34ae40f20cb.poster.avif?t=1753307306\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/e3ccb5c19ea728979482a34ae40f20cb.webm?t=1753307306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/e3ccb5c19ea728979482a34ae40f20cb.mp4?t=1753307306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Take the helm and become a spaceship pilot tasked with saving your home world. Travel the galaxy using interconnected space-jumping gates, outsmart your enemies and fulfil your mission.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/4c49ce9199671834f4a83d9d4da22b3b.avif?t=1753307306\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/3b4da7cda1bcc571ed825661924d1c1f.poster.avif?t=1753307306\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/3b4da7cda1bcc571ed825661924d1c1f.webm?t=1753307306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/3b4da7cda1bcc571ed825661924d1c1f.mp4?t=1753307306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Space</h2>Enjoy the freedom of flight, breath-taking views of entire galaxies and planetary clusters and explore them all. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/4c49ce9199671834f4a83d9d4da22b3b.avif?t=1753307306\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/3556ca61e16fe2dd9ac8bf4a303de7cf.poster.avif?t=1753307306\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/3556ca61e16fe2dd9ac8bf4a303de7cf.webm?t=1753307306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/3556ca61e16fe2dd9ac8bf4a303de7cf.mp4?t=1753307306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weapons</h2>Arm yourself and wreak havoc on your enemies with plasma cannons, guided missiles, or time bombs! With your onboard 3D printer, new weapon types or even ships are at your fingertips \u2013 just insert the blueprint!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/4c49ce9199671834f4a83d9d4da22b3b.avif?t=1753307306\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/2668fc8f0aeff66244703e5125cfd3d1.poster.avif?t=1753307306\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/2668fc8f0aeff66244703e5125cfd3d1.webm?t=1753307306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/2668fc8f0aeff66244703e5125cfd3d1.mp4?t=1753307306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat</h2>Face small and nimble enemy ships in fast-paced, intense combat that will test your agility and aiming skills. Plug in a controller or play the old-fashioned way, using a keyboard and mouse.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/e3ccb5c19ea728979482a34ae40f20cb.poster.avif?t=1753307306\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/e3ccb5c19ea728979482a34ae40f20cb.webm?t=1753307306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/e3ccb5c19ea728979482a34ae40f20cb.mp4?t=1753307306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Take the helm and become a spaceship pilot tasked with saving your home world. Travel the galaxy using interconnected space-jumping gates, outsmart your enemies and fulfil your mission.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/4c49ce9199671834f4a83d9d4da22b3b.avif?t=1753307306\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/3b4da7cda1bcc571ed825661924d1c1f.poster.avif?t=1753307306\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/3b4da7cda1bcc571ed825661924d1c1f.webm?t=1753307306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/3b4da7cda1bcc571ed825661924d1c1f.mp4?t=1753307306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Space</h2>Enjoy the freedom of flight, breath-taking views of entire galaxies and planetary clusters and explore them all. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/4c49ce9199671834f4a83d9d4da22b3b.avif?t=1753307306\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/3556ca61e16fe2dd9ac8bf4a303de7cf.poster.avif?t=1753307306\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/3556ca61e16fe2dd9ac8bf4a303de7cf.webm?t=1753307306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/3556ca61e16fe2dd9ac8bf4a303de7cf.mp4?t=1753307306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weapons</h2>Arm yourself and wreak havoc on your enemies with plasma cannons, guided missiles, or time bombs! With your onboard 3D printer, new weapon types or even ships are at your fingertips \u2013 just insert the blueprint!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/4c49ce9199671834f4a83d9d4da22b3b.avif?t=1753307306\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/2668fc8f0aeff66244703e5125cfd3d1.poster.avif?t=1753307306\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/2668fc8f0aeff66244703e5125cfd3d1.webm?t=1753307306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/extras/2668fc8f0aeff66244703e5125cfd3d1.mp4?t=1753307306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat</h2>Face small and nimble enemy ships in fast-paced, intense combat that will test your agility and aiming skills. Plug in a controller or play the old-fashioned way, using a keyboard and mouse.",
